# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TableTrack — environment template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Real secrets must NEVER be committed. This file documents the variables
# the platform reads. Most provider credentials (including 2Factor.in) are
# managed in Super Admin → Provider Center and stored encrypted in the
# database — the variables below are only used as fallback defaults for
# local development and the "Test OTP" / "Test SMS" buttons before any
# provider row exists.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2Factor.in (SMS + OTP)
# Sign up at https://2factor.in, copy the API key from the dashboard,
# and paste it into Super Admin → Provider Center → SMS / OTP → 2Factor.in.
# The values below are dev-only fallbacks; the live key lives in the DB.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
TWOFACTOR_API_KEY=
# OTP template name registered with 2Factor (used for the AUTOGEN OTP flow).
TWOFACTOR_DEFAULT_TEMPLATE=OTP1
# Default country code prepended to mobiles missing a "+" prefix.
TWOFACTOR_DEFAULT_COUNTRY_CODE=+91
